.env

# Runtime save data. This is generated/appended to during play (every shift,
# jump, drift, observe, time-travel, and dead-end discovery can add new
# locations here) and is NOT a curated fixture — it must never be committed,
# since exploration order and bugs from past runs bake themselves permanently
# into whatever gets checked in. A fresh checkout starts from the small
# in-code seed graph in internal/interface/cli/default_universe.go instead.
data/locations.json
